nt"'::jsonb, '"Set the background image in CSS and keep text contrast readable"'::jsonb, '"Use the image as the only text content"'::jsonb, '"Set the document title to the image URL"'::jsonb, '"That its title is colourful"'::jsonb, '"That it loads quickly"'::jsonb, '"That its domain/URL is authentic and the service is expected"'::jsonb, '"That browser history is empty"'::jsonb, '"Add specific subject terms and quote an exact phrase when helpful; verify domains"'::jsonb, '"Search only website"'::jsonb, '"Disable the address bar"'::jsonb, '"Use PowerPoint animation"'::jsonb, '"Create a hyperlink to the target slide"'::jsonb, '"Add a spell-check flag"'::jsonb, '"Change only the slide master font"'::jsonb, '"Set printer to landscape"'::jsonb, '"Open because urgent email is trusted"'::jsonb, '"Forward it to all contacts"'::jsonb, '"Disable security software"'::jsonb, '"Verify sender and file through a trusted channel first"'::jsonb, '"Editor"'::jsonb, '"Viewer"'::jsonb, '"Owner"'::jsonb, '"Administrator"'::jsonb, '"Copy first result without checking"'::jsonb, '"Use only search snippets"'::jsonb, '"Read relevant pages, record actual domains and compare important claims"'::jsonb, '"Assume all results are official"'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY['1'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '0'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, '1'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);
